{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.065406976597420896,"t":"Introduction","w":0.11522633870442707,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.094650205005353885},{"c":1,"x":0.096707818672271559,"y":0.11191860447019963,"w":0.10493827184041342,"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"Speaking"},{"y":0.13542289377303374,"x":0.094571394737097872,"h":0.019326123528542349,"c":1,"w":0.75533640543619796,"t":"This test takes between 11 and 14 minutes and is conducted by a trained examiner."},{"y":0.15547703167707416,"x":0.096707815922967108,"w":0.1995884831746419,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"There are three parts:"},{"w":0.060069942474365243,"x":0.096508238540918487,"y":0.18412339355378327,"h":0.014020654703057134,"t":"Part 1","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"The candidate and the examiner introduce themselves. Candidates then answer general","w":0.79629628499348959,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.20639534869146148,"x":0.096707824478830376},{"x":0.096707830731255537,"w":0.81069956461588544,"h":0.017486372881418744,"c":1,"t":"questions about themselves, their home\/family, their job\/studies, their interests and a wide","y":0.22379269703962446},{"t":"range of similar familiar topic areas. This part lasts between four and five minutes.","w":0.74085845947265627,"h":0.018170706655729285,"y":0.2405716614803084,"c":1,"x":0.094601851887515992},{"t":"Part 2","x":0.096435758871438015,"w":0.060214900970458979,"h":0.015690423855371449,"c":1,"y":0.26977106700679698},{"c":1,"w":0.80246912638346346,"h":0.014558851648696747,"t":"The candidate is given a task card with prompts and is asked to talk on a particular topic.","x":0.096707823530776407,"y":0.29358068336365917},{"w":0.77572016398111976,"h":0.017667844522968101,"x":0.096707819140018123,"y":0.31095406347127441,"t":"The candidate has one minute to prepare and they can make some notes if they wish,","c":1},{"y":0.32848837194639657,"h":0.016034596379148724,"t":"before speaking for between one and two minutes. The examiner then asks one or two","x":0.096707809995847452,"w":0.77983540852864575,"c":1},{"t":"questions on the same topic.","x":0.096707823226574549,"y":0.34593023281622459,"h":0.015988371257085632,"c":1,"w":0.26337448120117185},{"w":0.059670778910318995,"y":0.37499999984143295,"t":"Part 3","h":0.014575971731448756,"c":1,"x":0.096707820322460003},{"c":1,"t":"The examiner and the candidate engage in a discussion of more abstract issues which are","w":0.81481480916341142,"y":0.39811542992868387,"x":0.096707821648222989,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"w":0.83550008138020848,"x":0.094604317071223909,"c":1,"h":0.017462415324504432,"y":0.41424421905478304,"t":"thematically linked to the topic in Part 2. The discussion lasts between four and five minutes."},{"t":"The Speaking test assesses whether candidates can communicate effectively in English.","h":0.017403380188419582,"x":0.096659218927363968,"w":0.80051452636718756,"c":1,"y":0.44038392550736238},{"t":"The assessment takes into account Fluency and Coherence, Lexical Resource, Grammatical","w":0.83950617472330713,"h":0.017441860778592888,"x":0.096707817881585639,"c":1,"y":0.45930232542243232},{"y":0.47533711577991822,"t":"Range and Accuracy, and Pronunciation. More information on assessing the Speaking test,","x":0.096658917811308628,"w":0.82315383911132811,"c":1,"h":0.018868248650828257},{"c":1,"w":0.81687240600585931,"y":0.49411071845086219,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.094650216633381204,"t":"including Speaking assessment criteria (public version), is available on the IELTS website."},{"x":0.09670781898509713,"t":"6","w":0.016460905075073223,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.93749999975163234},{"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39469720757347232,"y":0.96598359674835832,"w":0.20851318359374998,"h":0.018254359844014467,"c":1}]}